    "Mechanical function of the frozen protocol and the licence register; never a researcher choice.",
    "The register status is the status of the latest dated entry on or before the evaluation date.",
    "The REAL_TIME condition of primary_comparator_rule applies per origin through the data gate and is not recorded here; this document fixes the member list, not the data availability of an origin.",
